// a single-target cast and charges the difference against the stack the
// hero already committed.  get_spell_work_chance is the resist chance,
// so the surviving fraction is (1 - chance).
//
// `chance` is a DOUBLE local, not a float: retail spills the call's
// float return with `fstp qword`, i.e. at full precision, and only
// forms (1 - chance) when the other factor is already on the stack.
// A `float chance` stores `fstp dword` and folds the subtraction
